  "description": "打开审核标准管理，验证表格列（标准名称/创建人/使用次数等）、筛选项与新建标准入口。基于预发真实路由 /review/standard-management。",
  "businessType": "f88_material",
  "scene": "f88-test",
  "priority": "P1",
  "category": "smoke",
  "context": {
    "urlPattern": "pre-aifashion-xiaoer.alibaba-inc.com",
    "url": "https://pre-aifashion-xiaoer.alibaba-inc.com/review/standard-management",
